    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for checking on that. Just to be certain before I sign off—when you say they're 'routine,' did you look specifically for any patterns involving split transactions or amounts just below the reporting thresholds? I've heard some talk about structured activity in that area, so I want to be 100% sure we aren't dismissing something as a 'clerical error' that's actually a pattern.",
